  "title": "100 Day's at Freddy's",
  "description": "\"If Five Nights weren't difficult enough.\"",
  "body": "\"If Five Nights weren't difficult enough.\"\n\n-------------------------\n\n100 Day's at Freddy's ( Also known as AHDaF ), is a FNaF themed modpack for the Forge 1.19.2 version of Minecraft, which includes content from the famous FNaF games and more!\n\nSince Modrinth ( shockingly ) didn't have a FNaF themed modpack, i decided to be the first one to try making one!\n\nInspired by various other FNaF themed modpacks out there.\n\nHope you guys enjoy!\n\n-------------------------\n\nI highly reccomend you check the keybinds and rebind any thing that conflicts.",
